# 🏛️ **Official Launch of the First Strategic Road Infrastructure Development Project in the Game**

### **In the Name of God**

We hereby announce the official launch of the **first construction project of AMIRIAN CORPORATION 2026**, dedicated to the planning, construction, and development of road infrastructure within the game environment.

The project is designed to establish an extensive, organized, and functional road network while supporting the development and expansion of the game's urban infrastructure. The project will be implemented in multiple phases according to the approved development plan.

